s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:24.122Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","session_id":"f86a03a7-81af-4a14-8384-a079b2439b2a","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"d14a1677-4ada-4600-9e8d-ef29610c7129","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"5cb0649c-ff0c-4af2-aac6-d3fc660ba292","thread":"d14a1677-4ada-4600-9e8d-ef29610c7129","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-5cb0649c-ff0c-4af2-aac6-d3fc660ba292"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-vvsf3z62/c-42k4oixh/state/worktrees/72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","base_commit":"7aeb24082ce4b495c101b9273401837137d49da7","card_snapshot_id":"8ce47973-f3d3-4e9d-9d82-1072b52b3398","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:25.278Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-vvsf3z62/c-42k4oixh/repo","cat-file","-t","5ee7105ef0c1dca44b18b31aad3a1e15a6541047"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-vvsf3z62/c-42k4oixh/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:25.283Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-vvsf3z62/c-42k4oixh/repo","cat-file","-t","5ee7105ef0c1dca44b18b31aad3a1e15a6541047"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-vvsf3z62/c-42k4oixh/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:20:25.284Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"72130911-fe38-40f4-8725-20f1ebd5dd7e","type":